WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.700
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.200
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:23.960
You are my sun now

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.420
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.420
no matter who you are

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.840
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.520
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:50.940
is clear again

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:56.280
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.830
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.790
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:16.680
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.470
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:30.810
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:38.200
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.190
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:03.100
<i>Together with my companions, Barda and Jasmine, I defeated several terrifying monsters and recovered six gems.</i>

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:07.660
<i>But to be honest, when I left the Forests of Silence to go on a journey with a stubborn old guy,</i>

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:07.630
<i>Hey!</i>

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.200
<i>along with this unreliable boy,</i>

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:10.200
<i>What was that?</i>

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>I could only hope that
everything would be alright.</i>

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.000
<i>But by working together,
we've finally made it this far!</i>

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.100
<i>There's only one gem remaining!</i>

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:24.610
<i>Our last perilous destination, The Valley of the Lost where the diamond is hidden, is just right ahead!</i>

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:38.610
This mirror is able to project
the target's greatest weakness.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:46.300
So I'm sure those three must be suffering by now, given that they're having to face exactly that.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.500
Doesn't it sound wonderful?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.700
Yeah.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.470
It's really exciting.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:56.220
Agonising, suffering and lost for words.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.140
A perfectly suitable end for those
three, wouldn't you agree?

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:09.800
Now, draw your sword, other me!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:13.320
B-But why do I have to
fight against my own self?!

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.050
Because I despise you.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.660
You, who acts all nice while spouting pretty words in the name of justice.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.820
And you must hate me also.

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:28.650
The one who is weak and
always trembling in fear;

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:33.000
the pathetic me who can't
do anything without his friends.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:38.100
Are you surprised by how much I know?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.880
It is to be expected; I am you, after all.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.500
Of course I would know
everything about you!

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.230
You've become quite nervous, haven't you?

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.400
Prepare yourself, the me that I hate!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.600
Stop resisting!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.200
You're just a weakling, after all.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.900
A weakling who can't do anything on his own!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:12.300
Prandine! How could it be...

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:14.500
I told you, didn't I?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.820
It is because I am your weakness.

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:21.310
That's why I have come here to defeat you.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.600
En garde!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.900
It's futile! You will never be able to defeat me!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.800
You couldn't even protect your own mother...!

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.540
Now, let's begin.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:12.820
Now, remember this arrangement. If you can't
stack it exactly like this, we'll eat you!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.240
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:20.380
Your weakness is your impatience and your
dislike for cramped spaces, after all.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.740
If you can't do this, you lose!
And we'll eat you!

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:33.580
There's no need to push yourself, other me.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.050
Just give up and accept your defeat already!

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.800
Admit it. You hate scary things, right?

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.720
And you hate fighting, don't you?

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:51.700
<i>I mustn't... If I surrender here,
I won't be able to save Deltora...!</i>

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:53.500
<i>But...</i>

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.280
Just give up, you stubborn fool!

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.970
There's no way you can win against me.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.990
Just accept your weakness,

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.100
other me!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:17.300
Don't you think it's about
time you surrendered?

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:20.520
Don't forget, you couldn't
even protect your mother.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.110
Someone so weak could
never hope to defeat me!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.000
Much less protect the
people of this kingdom!

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.710
Just give up and stop resisting.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:36.000
Do that, and I will at least spare your life.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:42.160
Your time to memorise is up!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:49.500
Now, build it again in the exact same
way! If you can't do it, then you lose!

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.860
And we'll eat you!!

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.900
Now, hurry up.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.000
Rearrange the blocks the way they just were.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:03.270
Fine! I'll do it.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.000
There's no way I'm going
to be eaten by you guys.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.200
So...

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.900
The bottom block was...

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:19.590
Like this! And this should be next.

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:22.800
After that should be this
one, and it should face...

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:24.620
...this way!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:29.750
What the hell? She's actually remembered the
pattern, and she's not even making any mistakes!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.600
That's weird... She was supposed
to fail this completely...

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:37.160
It's all your fault! You made it way too easy!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.360
What?! This is <i>your</i> fault!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.480
No, it's yours!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:44.280
Shut up! I'll forget the pattern
if you keep being so noisy!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.110
Uh... this girl is kind of scary...

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.140
Well <i>you're</i> the one who made her angry.

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.960
Never mind that! Just keep quiet.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.240
I can do this...!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.000
I'll show you that I can rearrange
this just from memory!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.260
Hey, could it be that...

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.000
...she's actually nervous?

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:04.520
Yeah, she's scared!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.700
Come on, make a mistake!

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.700
Make a mistake and let us eat you!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.080
Yeah, let us eat you already!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.100
This is it!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.600
Big mistake!

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.300
If only Lief and Barda were
here with me right now...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:03.500
<i>Shit...! If Lief and Jasmine were here,
I wouldn't lose to this man...!</i>

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.100
<i>Jasmine... Barda...</i>

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.510
<i>Please lend me your strength!</i>

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.320
What on earth is taking those kids so long?!

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:27.570
Those three still haven't been killed?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.900
Honestly, what a persistent bunch...!

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:36.300
Oh magic mirror, reveal more
of their weaknesses to me!

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.020
I see...

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.510
So we can do that as well...

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:53.300
Um, this one should be like this,

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.120
and lastly...

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.330
No, that's wrong, I don't
think they were like this.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:02.320
Ahh, geez! Why can't I
remember the pattern?!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.530
Oww, it hurts

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.530
- It hurts, it hurts!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.880
So it was you two after all!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:14.790
Um, uhh, what are we supposed to say again?

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:17.220
You idiot, it goes this way.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:20.040
Now you, listen carefully.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:24.600
We don't mind sparing that Lief guy's life if you offer yours in return.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:29.800
Yeah, yeah! We can spare his life.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.310
What?!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:39.830
Huh?

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:44.400
So it was you guys?! Stop
messing around with adults!

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.940
Uhh, umm...

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.820
A-Anyway, you tell him!

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.180
R-Right! I have to say it!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.560
Now you, listen carefully.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.600
Forfeit your life if you
want to save that Lief guy!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.250
If you do, we'll at least spare his life.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.360
That's right. We'll let him live.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.660
Get it?

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.520
Now, what will you do?

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:20.000
Will you sacrifice your life for Lief?

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:24.300
Or perhaps, are you afraid to sacrifice
your own life for your friend?

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:31.820
What's wrong? Are you afraid
of dying in Lief's place?

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.250
Are you afraid?

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:47.750
Kill me!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.800
I will protect Lief, even if it
costs me my own life!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.000
If all I need to save Lief is
to give my life, then so be it!

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:04.600
What will you do?
You heard what they said.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:09.500
Both of them will die
if you don't surrender.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.400
Or are you fine with that,

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:15.600
other me?

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.100
It seems to be working well.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:26.890
What did you do, Mama?

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.980
Those three share a powerful
bond with each other,

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:33.300
so I took advantage of that.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.900
Their affection for one
another will be their undoing.

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:58.560
I'll say it as many times as I have to!
I will protect Lief, even if it costs me my life!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.300
Just kill me!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.200
If all I need to save Lief is to
give my life, then so be it!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.800
No way...

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:12.000
So I can't avoid that dream
coming true after all...?

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:21.200
<i>Just kill me! If all I need to save
Lief is to give my life, then so be it!</i>

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:27.120
<i>I will protect Lief, even if
it costs me my own life!</i>

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:31.900
No!

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:35.610
You two... you can't just
do something like that!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.220
You're both my irreplaceable comrades...!

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:44.040
I refuse to let you sacrifice your
lives so that I alone can live on!

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.100
What should I do...?

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:56.700
The ruby's growing pale and turning pink...?

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.200
The belt is telling me that it senses danger.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.020
I see!

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.400
Could it be... this mirror?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.000
What?!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.140
Thaegan!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:22.720
H-How?!

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:26.450
I figured out that this mirror
was the source of your power!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:28.990
Huh?

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:36.600
You lot!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.980
Hey, we're back...!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.240
But why?

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.980
Did we just lose?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.900
Now that it has come to this...

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.680
It's your turn, Ichabod.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:49.000
Destroy him until there's nothing left!

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.760
Can I eat him?

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:53.500
Why of course.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.650
All of him? Just for me?

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.980
Yes, of course, Ichabod.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:02.400
There's no need for you to combine
your strength with the others.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.200
You can do this however you'd like to.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.200
Okay. I'm gonna do it, Mama.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.540
Good boy.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.170
I'm your opponent now!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.500
You again?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.320
You can't run anymore now!
Prepare yourself!

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:46.500
Not good! At this rate, I'll...!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.400
Well done, Ichabod.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.400
Time to end this!

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.320
Now, my lovely, hideous child,

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.850
hurry up and tear him limb from limb!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.850
Okay, Mama!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.100
That's not fair, giving him all to Ichabod!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:15.620
I want to eat too!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.500
I want to eat, I want to eat!

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:17.480
Why can't I eat him?!

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.500
I also want some of him!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:22.560
Honestly, you noisy children.
Just be silent and watch!

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:25.770
But it's not fair if it's only Ichabod, Mama!

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:29.040
That's right! We worked
really hard for Mama too!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:27.910
Yeah, yeah!

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.320
If you don't be quiet you will be punished!

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:01.580
Ichabod...?

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.950
She killed him!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.840
Mama, Ichabod is...

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.380
He's been killed!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.910
Ichabod!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.240
How dare you...!

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:16.460
Barda!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.600
B-But how...?

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.920
If one of us is in trouble, the remaining
two will always come to their aid.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:29.130
That's the way we do things, right?

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:35.300
You're the one who keeps forgetting
that and doing weird things, Lief.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:36.920
Sorry...

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:41.330
But, when you guys said that you would
throw away your lives to protect me...

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.180
That's only if it comes to that, silly.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:48.000
That's right. We're a unit of three.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:51.820
I think all of us would hate being
left alone, don't you think?

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.470
I would definitely hate it.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.400
Jasmine...

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.090
Now, let's settle this fight now!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:17:59.380
Right!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.620
Here we come, Thaegan!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:06.050
We'll be sure to leave you in a
state that you won't revive from!

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.230
Prepare yourself!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.500
Be silent!

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:13.300
This may be my last chance, but it is
you who should prepare yourselves!

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:14.400
Thaegan!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.740
Now, allow me to deliver the final blow.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.500
Oh, right...!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.520
No! Stop it!

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:58.180
That's not me! That's not the real me!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:05.800
This is bad!

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.610
Mama's magical power is being
sucked into the mirror!

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.700
Look, Mama is...

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.810
Mama has turned into an old lady!

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:31.480
What happened to her...?

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:36.500
She has lived for hundreds
of years, after all...

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:40.090
It's no surprise that she'd turn
into such an old woman.

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:41.900
No...

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.680
I don't want to be old like this...

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:50.000
Not like this!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.200
Mama!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.240
Mama!

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.500
No! Don't go!!

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:00.860
I'm going with you too!

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:01.810
Me too!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:02.780
I'm coming too!

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:03.720
Me too!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.400
Mama!

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.720
Mama! Mama!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.000
You all really are foolish.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.200
Why did you follow me?!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.300
But...! But...!

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.100
We want to be together with Mama!

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.290
I don't want us to be apart again!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:26.810
We want to be together with you!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:30.300
We want to be by your side, Mama.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.530
Mama... You're so warm...

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.100
Eh?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.890
My children...

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.900
Come here, my children...

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:07.740
Rainbow...?

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.400
Yeah...

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.100
Mama!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.200
We love you!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.120
Thaegan is really dead now?

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:35.800
Yeah.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.700
Along with her children, huh...

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:39.700
Yeah.

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:43.400
Why her children too?

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:48.400
In reality, any child would
prefer to be with their mother.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:54.000
Perhaps even Thaegan was a good
mother in her children's eyes.

00:21:55.640 --> 00:22:01.800
For just a moment, I felt like I saw Thaegan with a really
kind expression on her face, surrounded by her children...

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:05.800
Mothers are nice, aren't they?

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:08.400
Yeah.

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.420
The one who deserves our
hate is the Shadow Lord.

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:21.260
Until he is defeated, no one can be truly happy!

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:25.280
Let's go! To the Valley of the Lost!

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:27.700
We will take back the last gem!

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:08.200
<i>Thaegan's Ring.</i>

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:11.910
<i>A magical ring that Thagean wore on her pinky.</i>

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:15.700
<i>While she was defeated by Lief
and the others at the Lake of Tears,</i>

00:24:15.700 --> 00:24:18.800
<i>she was able to revive due to the ring's magic.</i>

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:24.000
We finally found Dain on a bandit ship.

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:30.680
However, in the midst of our battle, the Shadow Lord sent a man who engulfed everything in a magical fire.

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:34.530
The Sorcerer Oacus Appears

00:24:31.560 --> 00:24:34.530
Next time, 'The Sorcerer Oacus Appears'.

00:24:49.500 --> 00:24:54.470
See you next time
